<div class="sedna-col" style="max-width:460px">
    <p class="text-muted text-sm">
        On this desktop all four insets are 0px, so the first bar is exactly the bar you would
        write anyway. The second sets --safe-block-end to 34px by hand — an iPhone's home
        indicator — to show what the class then does.
    </p>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-body sedna-row">
            <span class="sedna-fill">Your own action bar</span>
            <button class="btn btn--sm btn--brand btn--solid" type="button">Save</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="--safe-block-end:34px">
        <div class="card-body sedna-row sedna-safe-bottom">
            <span class="sedna-fill">The same bar, with .sedna-safe-bottom</span>
            <button class="btn btn--sm btn--brand btn--solid" type="button">Save</button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
